{"seq":1,"slug":"python-programming-data","title":"Python 编程与数据处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/python-programming-data","wordCount":897,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"python-编程与数据处理\">Python 编程与数据处理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>Python 凭借其简洁语法和丰富的数据科学生态，已成为数字经济领域最主流的编程语言。掌握 Python 编程与数据处理能力，是数字经济专业学生进入数据分析、机器学习和自动化运营的第一道门槛。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础语法与数据结构\">基础语法与数据结构</h3><p>Python 的核心数据结构包括列表（list）、字典（dict）、元组（tuple）和集合（set）。理解它们的时间复杂度差异是高效编程的前提：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>列表索引访问 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，插入/删除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>字典查找/插入/删除均为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（哈希表实现）</li>\n<li>集合支持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的成员判断，适合去重与交集运算</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 字典推导式：快速构建映射&#10;sales_data = {&quot;北京&quot;: 1200, &quot;上海&quot;: 1500, &quot;深圳&quot;: 980}&#10;high_sales = {city: val for city, val in sales_data.items() if val &gt; 1000}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 字典推导式：快速构建映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sales_data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"北京\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"上海\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"深圳\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">980</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">high_sales </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {city: val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city, val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sales_data.items() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"函数式编程与模块化\">函数式编程与模块化</h3><p>数据处理管道通常由多个转换步骤组成，函数式风格可以提升代码的可读性和可测试性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from functools import reduce&#10;&#10;transactions = [100, -50, 200, -30, 150]&#10;# 累计余额计算&#10;balances = list(accumulate(transactions))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> reduce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">transactions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 累计余额计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">balances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(accumulate(transactions))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Lambda 表达式配合 <code>map()</code>、<code>filter()</code> 可以构造简洁的数据转换链。但当逻辑复杂时，应优先使用具名函数以保持可维护性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"numpy-向量化计算\">NumPy 向量化计算</h3><p>NumPy 的 ndarray 通过连续内存布局和 SIMD 指令实现高效计算。向量化操作比 Python 原生循环快 10-100 倍：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;# 计算收益率&#10;prices = np.array([100, 105, 103, 110, 108])&#10;returns = np.diff(prices) / prices[:-1]  # 向量化除法\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 计算收益率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prices </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">105</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">103</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">110</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">108</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">returns </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.diff(prices) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prices[:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 向量化除法</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键概念包括广播（broadcasting）机制：当两个数组形状不同时，NumPy 自动扩展较小维度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>shape</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>shape</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mtext>shape</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{shape}(3,1) + \\text{shape}(1,4) \\rightarrow \\text{shape}(3,4)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shape</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shape</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shape</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"pandas-数据分析\">Pandas 数据分析</h3><p>Pandas 的 DataFrame 是结构化数据处理的核心工具。典型的数据清洗流程包括：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>缺失值处理</strong>：<code>dropna()</code>、<code>fillna(method=&#39;ffill&#39;)</code></li>\n<li><strong>类型转换</strong>：<code>astype()</code>、<code>pd.to_datetime()</code></li>\n<li><strong>数据聚合</strong>：<code>groupby().agg()</code></li>\n<li><strong>透视表</strong>：<code>pivot_table(values, index, columns, aggfunc)</code></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;&#10;df = pd.read_csv(&quot;ecommerce_orders.csv&quot;)&#10;# 按月份统计各品类销售额&#10;monthly_sales = df.groupby([df[&#39;date&#39;].dt.to_period(&#39;M&#39;), &#39;category&#39;])[&#39;amount&#39;].sum()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.read_csv(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ecommerce_orders.csv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按月份统计各品类销售额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">monthly_sales </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.groupby([df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'date'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].dt.to_period(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'M'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'category'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'amount'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].sum()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据处理管道设计\">数据处理管道设计</h3><p>实际项目中，数据处理通常形成多步骤管道。良好的管道设计应遵循：输入输出明确、步骤可独立测试、错误可追溯。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;原始数据采集&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;数据清洗与标准化&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;特征工程&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;数据验证&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;输出存储&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;可视化报告&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"原始数据采集\"] --&gt; B[\"数据清洗与标准化\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"特征工程\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"数据验证\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"输出存储\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"可视化报告\"]</pre><h3 id=\"文件-i-o-与序列化\">文件 I/O 与序列化</h3><p>数字经济场景中常见的数据格式包括 CSV、JSON、Parquet 和 Excel：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>读取速度</th>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CSV</td>\n<td>小规模交换</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parquet</td>\n<td>大数据分析</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>API 交互</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Parquet 采用列式存储，适合分析查询场景，其压缩率通常可达原始 CSV 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li>2026 年 Python 3.13 引入 Free-threading（无 GIL 模式），显著提升多线程数据处理性能</li>\n<li>Polars 库以 Rust 为后端，在大规模 DataFrame 操作中性能超越 Pandas 3-10 倍</li>\n<li>AI 辅助编程工具（GitHub Copilot、Cursor）改变了 Python 数据处理代码的编写方式</li>\n<li>DuckDB 作为嵌入式分析数据库，支持直接对 Parquet/CSV 执行 SQL 查询</li>\n<li>Jupyter AI 插件支持在 Notebook 中直接调用大语言模型辅助数据分析</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>使用 Pandas 读取一份电商订单数据，完成缺失值处理、异常值检测和按日期聚合统计</li>\n<li>比较使用 Python 循环与 NumPy 向量化分别计算 100 万条数据均值的时间差异</li>\n<li>设计一个数据处理管道函数，输入原始 CSV 文件路径，输出清洗后的 DataFrame</li>\n<li>讨论：在什么场景下应选择 Polars 替代 Pandas？性能之外还需考虑哪些因素？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Python 编程与数据处理是数字经济专业的技术基石。从基础语法到 NumPy/Pandas 生态，学生需要建立&quot;数据即资产、代码即工具&quot;的思维模式，通过反复的实操练习将编程能力内化为解决经济问题的核心手段。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Python 编程与数据处理","id":"python-编程与数据处理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"基础语法与数据结构","id":"基础语法与数据结构"},{"level":3,"text":"函数式编程与模块化","id":"函数式编程与模块化"},{"level":3,"text":"NumPy 向量化计算","id":"numpy-向量化计算"},{"level":3,"text":"Pandas 数据分析","id":"pandas-数据分析"},{"level":3,"text":"数据处理管道设计","id":"数据处理管道设计"},{"level":3,"text":"文件 I/O 与序列化","id":"文件-i-o-与序列化"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"编程与数据基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/programming-and-data-foundations"},"next":{"title":"数据库与云计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/database-and-cloud-computing"}}